{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgV8i6Fg1ttX95woHioHb", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_014f1AS9o3DoD3Mrx7CqCnRk", "name": "Bash", "input": {"command": "cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Payments module\n\n`shop/payments.py` computes order totals and refunds.\n\n- `TAX_RATE`: sales tax rate applied to orders (`0.0825`, i.e. 8.25%).\n- `line_total(price, quantity)`: returns `price * quantity` for one order line.\n- `order_total(lines)`: takes a list of `(price, quantity)` tuples and returns the\n  subtotal plus tax, rounded to 2 decimal places.\n- `refund(order_total_amount, amount)`: returns `order_total_amount - amount`, the\n  balance left after refunding `amount`.\n\n```python\nfrom shop.payments import line_total, order_total, refund\n\nline_total(5.00, 3)                      # 15.0\ntotal = order_total([(10.00, 2), (5.00, 1)])\nprint(total)                             # 27.06 (25.00 subtotal + 8.25% tax)\nprint(refund(total, 5.00))               # 22.06\n```\nEOF\npython3 -c \"\nfrom shop.payments import *\nt=order_total([(10.00,2),(5.00,1)]);print(t,refund(t,5.0))\"\nawk 'length>=100' README.md"}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 472, "cache_read_input_tokens": 38139, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 472}, "output_tokens": 20, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T18:47:39.874Z", "request_id": "req_011CgV8i5o8WQ3gPBryjLDJo", "wire_tool_inputs": {"toolu_014f1AS9o3DoD3Mrx7CqCnRk": {"command": "cd /tmp/skilldiff-crj6_qo_/ws && cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Payments module\n\n`shop/payments.py` computes order to